<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- What the game asks Apple for: the Game Center capability, and nothing else. The App ID of the bundle identifier needs
     the same capability turned on in the Apple Developer account, and the provisioning profile made after that carries
     it (docs/ios.md). An unsigned build does not embed this file; a signed one does. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>com.apple.developer.game-center</key>
    <true/>
</dict>
</plist>
